# Copy this file to config.env (same folder) and fill it in. Never commit config.env.
# Every line is optional: anything left out uses the default written next to it.

# Your MongoDB Atlas connection string (the class calls it DB). Put the database name (check-in) before the "?".
# Leave it commented out to use a MongoDB running on your own computer.
